WEBVTT

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.250
Yuki-chan,

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:11.060
are you cold?

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.290
I'm totally fine.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:17.770
I'm warm just by touching you like this.

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:18.730
I see.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:21.090
What about you?

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:27.160
I'm also happy when I'm with you.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.420
I see.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:29.670
That's good.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:35.950
I've been fine ever since you started wearing socks when we go to bed.

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:39.170
But my feet are a little cold now.

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.460
You are so cold-blooded.

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:44.100
You are just too warm-blooded!

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.840
Am I?

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:49.020
It's hard to tell, myself.

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:52.880
You come equipped with puni-puni-feeling fatty meat as a standard package...

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:53.540
Hey now...
You come equipped with puni-puni-feeling fatty meat as a standard package...

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:54.420
Hey now...

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:55.530
Question!

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:57.700
What is it this time, Yukino-san?

00:00:58.690 --> 00:00:59.880
What?

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:00.810
What is it?

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.670
"Puni-puni" is an onomatopoeia, right?

00:01:03.670 --> 00:01:05.250
Is it?

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.220
Probably.

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:08.070
Then what about "gami-gami"?

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.360
"Gami-gami"?

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:11.050
You mean...

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:12.940
this?

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:14.520
Yeah!

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:18.780
I wonder what it is?

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:21.630
We can tell that a person is scolding with that alone.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:24.300
Maybe it's something like a symbol.

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.020
Just like "koro-koro" and "gera-gera."

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:28.310
Gami-gami...

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:29.960
Gami-gami...

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:33.280
Gami-gami, gami-gami...

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:34.090
Mimigaa!

00:01:34.090 --> 00:01:35.610
No, not that.

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:39.110
Besides, stop before you cause a Gestalt disintegration.

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:44.170
I do my thing and you do your thing.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:50.320
But how a coincidence brought us together is a very wonderful thing.

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:56.890
That sounds pretty nice, but that's the Gestalt Prayer.

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:00.640
What's wrong, Yuki-chan?

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:01.630
Are you okay?

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:08.670
Um...

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:11.180
Kana-chan, I'm hungry.

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:12.870
Oh, right, sorry.

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:16.860
You like foxes, so you're a fox, right?

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:21.650
I like foxes too, but I like Kana-chan much more!

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.720
That's great to hear.

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:26.000
Oh yeah.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.900
Yuki-chan, do you want this?

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:29.590
What's that?

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:30.540
Mimigaa.

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:31.790
No!

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:35.930
Then should we go to the cake store in front of the train station?

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:40.220
But Kana-chan said not to follow strangers.

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:43.830
That's right, you should be careful.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.580
So, what do you want to eat?

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:48.430
Well...

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:56.450
Is it good?

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:57.310
Yeah!

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:58.330
Is it?

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:59.760
Good.

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:02.610
Kana-chan, Kana-chan.

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:04.800
What is it?

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:08.330
Are you studying for your exams?

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:16.570
What a bad way to wake up...

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:21.380
And I think that was a really embarrassing dream...

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:28.510
I see...

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:44.570
That's probably because of the new pajamas!

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:50.470
And because you really were nibbling on my finger, the dream turned out so silly!

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:51.100
Sheesh!

00:03:51.100 --> 00:03:53.270
It was so much better in the beginning.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:56.020
What was the beginning like?

00:03:57.610 --> 00:03:59.660
It's embarrassing, so I'll pass.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.190
No fun!

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:05.750
So, why were you eating a cheese stick?

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:07.040
Cheese stick?

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.770
What are you talking about?

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:11.140
But you said so!

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:15.330
When I pulled my finger out of your mouth, you said, "Cheese stick!"

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:16.670
Who did?

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:17.570
You did.

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:20.140
No, I did not!

00:04:20.140 --> 00:04:23.910
No! My cheese stick's flying away!

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.580
Cheese stick!

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:28.570
See?

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:30.760
No! Erase it! Now!

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:31.880
Please, Kana-chan!

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:33.120
No can do!

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:35.290
Save as permanent...

00:04:36.590 --> 00:04:37.750
Fine then!

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:41.830
I'll send your really embarrassing picture to Saku-chan...

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:42.590
That's not fair!
I'll send your really embarrassing picture to Saku-chan...

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:43.930
That's not fair!

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:44.970
When did you take that?!

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:45.800
Not telling!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.940
You better delete it!

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:49.510
Jeez!

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.300
You mustn't carry that around!

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:51.380
What's this?
You mustn't carry that around!

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:51.940
You mustn't carry that around!

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:52.880
Oh well.
You mustn't carry that around!

