Hey, morning roll call...

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.610
but...

00:05:02.690 --> 00:05:05.280
Shameless couple, present.

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.410
Wait! Hey!

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:12.990
So... we're considered a shameless couple huh, Kana-chan?

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:13.680
No, we're really normal.
So... we're considered a shameless couple huh, Kana-chan?

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:16.380
No, we're really normal.

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:18.370
I think.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:22.780
Oh Yuki-chan, can I see your notes about this thing on page 72?

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:25.970
Thank you.

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:32.180
Um, Yuki-chan...

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.350
Again?

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:36.540
This is way too hard!

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:37.770
I can't help it.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:41.650
That's why I told you that taking a second foreign language is not for you.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:46.240
But I never imagined that you'd take German.

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:49.880
And since we're in different departments, we can't spend much time together,

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:53.560
so I wanted to at least take some General Eds with you.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:56.100
And I knew I'd hate Math II.

00:05:56.100 --> 00:06:00.400
So that's why you picked another second language and World History?

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:04.000
Well, the only other choices were physics and math.

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:07.220
But I hate numbers.

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:12.250
Then fine, I'll teach you.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:15.700
What a troublesome kid you are!

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:19.880
I'm not totally happy about it, but please.

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:24.400
Oh, I want to eat a nikuman on the way home, Kana-chan!

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.170
If you're okay with the non-super grade one.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:29.110
It's a deal!

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.020
By the way...

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:34.780
you're going to get in trouble for doing that, Saku-chan.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:37.320
Oh nice. That's a new cell phone.
you're going to get in trouble for doing that, Saku-chan.

