00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:05.830
For today's snack, I'll have Kanade-senpai's...

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:07.410
Saku-chan, Saku-chan.

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:08.120
Yes?

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:08.890
Go!

00:07:10.030 --> 00:07:13.340
Kanade-senpai's strawberry milk!

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:16.620
She sure has high mobility.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:24.080
Yuki-chan, let's go to the bathroom together.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:35.410
Hey Yuki-chan, since school's letting out at noon for exam preps,

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:38.270
do you want to go home instead of staying here to study?

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:44.820
You don't study during the day and then rush everything in the evening, so no.

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:47.370
I can't deny that...

00:07:47.370 --> 00:07:53.460
Oh, I have somewhere I want to stop by, so would you go home without me?

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.690
Where are you going?

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:57.630
Well...

00:07:57.630 --> 00:07:59.540
Some shopping...

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:02.780
