00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:27.240
And I wanted to make it at least a little surprising...

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:29.380
Yeah.

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:32.080
Thank you, Kana-chan.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:37.830
