00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:02.060
That's hell.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.090
Yeah...

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:06.350
Oh yeah, Yuki-chan, be a model for me!

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:09.560
I'm used to drawing you, so I can get it done faster.

00:09:09.560 --> 00:09:11.960
Then we can go on a date on the 14th.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:14.940
You won't get upset if I move, like before?

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:16.560
I won't.

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:19.400
And you'll take me somewhere after the exams?

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:21.440
I'd be more than glad to.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:23.830
Then fine...

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:24.590
Yay.

00:09:24.590 --> 00:09:26.210
It still feels like you're getting the better end of the deal...
Thank you, Yuki-chan.

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:27.830
It still feels like you're getting the better end of the deal...

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.170
What's that?

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.520
Oh, this?

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:32.950
It's a pamphlet for the lab.

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:35.620
My instructor gave it to me.

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:36.840
