00:09:48.960 --> 00:09:52.800
We were really cutting it close timewise, so I was a bit worried.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.480
I'm glad it got there.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:55.240
Yeah.

00:09:56.310 --> 00:10:00.120
