00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:01.130
Is she skipping...

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:03.130
Kana-chan, Kana-chan,

00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:05.680
they're still on a ski trip.

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:06.960
Oh, right.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:10.390
So, what about her?

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:15.510
Well, I figured she'd definitely be here,

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.040
but I was hoping she'd prove me wrong.

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:19.090
Kanade-senpai...
but I was hoping she'd prove me wrong.

