Oh, I wonder if she came by car?

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:28.630
No wonder she wasn't at the train station this morning.

00:10:28.630 --> 00:10:32.550
I think she's planning to get into a box and then say,

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:36.230
"Here, take me, Senpai! And while we're here, let's go on a date!"

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:40.300
I think I'll be caught the minute I step into the hallway.

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:43.940
It <i>is</i> a special day.

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:47.200
I thought this might happen,

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:50.620
so I prepared a secret just for Saku-chan!

00:10:56.850 --> 00:11:00.930
Kanade-senpai, please rest up and get well soon.

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:04.510
See you, Kanade-senpai and Yukino-senpai.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:05.930
See ya...

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:08.020
What just happened?

