00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:02.930
Here you go, Kana-chan.

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:05.110
Say, "Ah."

00:13:05.110 --> 00:13:07.410
Wait, what are you doing, Yuki-chan?!

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:10.330
I thought you'd want to eat it this way.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:10.980
Okay?

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:27.250
How is it, Kana-chan?

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:28.200
Is it good?

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.670
Yes, very.

00:13:37.730 --> 00:13:39.540
That's good.

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:41.190
Do you want another bite?

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:43.270
Yes.

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:45.300
Oh yeah, Kana-chan,

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:48.610
