00:14:11.760 --> 00:14:16.800
I will sleep every night with this pillow of yours that Yukino-senpai gave me!

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:20.090
Senpai's sweet smell...

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:21.270
Smell...

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:27.420
With a tinge of fresh sourness...

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:23.310
So, you get no break after the exams, and you have to work on this?

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:24.780
Sorry.

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:26.260
What about us going out?

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:27.710
So sorry.

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:32.070
Well, fine.

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:37.270
Um, Kana-chan,

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:40.110
this was an assignment of sketches, right?

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:41.950
It was.

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:48.330
So you can't draw something fictitious...

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:50.380
Actually, the problem is more fundamental...

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:51.010
What? Why?
Actually, the problem is more fundamental...

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:51.590
What? Why?

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:52.820
Isn't she adorable?!

00:15:52.820 --> 00:15:54.570
And make you want to take her home?

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:56.710
Oh, also, Yuki-chan!

00:15:56.710 --> 00:16:00.270
She's never showed up again since that day!

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:00.280
I'm so...

00:16:00.280 --> 00:16:01.620
Kana-chan, Kana-chan!
I'm so...

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:02.000
Kana-chan, Kana-chan!

00:16:02.740 --> 00:16:05.400
Do you want to flunk out?

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:07.520
Sorry.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.920
Let me wake up.
